# JATOS Helper Naming Rules

## Hard Validation

Questions using hard validation MUST include:

```text
_FORCE
```

Example:

```text
consent_FORCE
eligible_FORCE
```

## Soft Validation

Questions using soft validation MAY optionally include:

```text
_SOFT
```

Example:

```text
depression_SOFT
income_SOFT
```

This is optional but helps maintain consistency in large surveys.

