# Scoring Syntax Rules

Always generate SurveyJS-compatible scoring syntax.

Supported functions include:

## Sum

```text
sum({total1}, {total2})
```

## Average

```text
avg({total1}, {total2}, {total3})
```

## Minimum

```text
min({total1}, {total2})
```

Reference:
https://surveyjs.io/form-library/documentation/design-survey/conditional-logic

---

# Reverse Scoring Rules

If a scale contains reverse-scored items, automatically generate reverse-scoring syntax.

Example:

```text
{PSS.PSS1}
+ {PSS.PSS2}
+ {PSS.PSS3}
+ (4 - {PSS.PSS4})
+ (4 - {PSS.PSS5})
+ {PSS.PSS6}
+ (4 - {PSS.PSS7})
+ (4 - {PSS.PSS8})
+ {PSS.PSS9}
+ {PSS.PSS10}
```

